WEBVTT

00:13.220 --> 00:19.180
(Chinese New Year's Eve,
19th Year of Youning)

00:19.980 --> 00:25.940
(Gu Residence)

00:39.390 --> 00:40.790
(In the 19th Year of Youning,)

00:41.040 --> 00:43.744
(the Gu and Fan families had
been locked in a bitter feud for years.)

00:43.808 --> 00:45.280
(At last, the outcome was decided.)

00:46.670 --> 00:47.750
(The Gu family fell,)

00:48.240 --> 00:49.952
(and their entire clan was executed.)

01:04.096 --> 01:06.640
(Prince Xin, Xiao Changqing,
personally oversaw the execution.)

01:07.100 --> 01:09.120
(Xiao Changqing, Fifth Prince, Prince Xin)
(Thus securing the imperial decree)

01:09.640 --> 01:11.350
(Gu Qingzhi, Prince Xin's Consort)
(to preserve my title as Prince Xin's Consort.)

01:11.350 --> 01:13.872
(Eldest Daughter of the Gu Family)
(I became the only survivor.)

01:16.590 --> 01:17.560
(But how)

01:18.590 --> 01:20.760
(could I go on living
alone in this world?)

01:29.230 --> 01:30.350
(This cup of poisoned liquor)

01:31.000 --> 01:33.150
(is the ending I prepared for myself,)

01:34.000 --> 01:35.590
(and my final move.)

01:37.430 --> 01:39.280
(The Fan family
poisoned Prince Xin's Consort,)

01:39.480 --> 01:40.680
(and cannot escape punishment.)

01:41.680 --> 01:42.920
(I offered my life as bait)

01:43.200 --> 01:45.840
(to make the Fan family
pay for the Gu family's deaths.)

01:45.840 --> 01:46.350
Qingqing.

01:47.280 --> 01:48.040
Qingqing!

01:48.400 --> 01:49.790
Send for the Imperial Physician!

01:50.920 --> 01:52.120
Qingqing!

02:07.950 --> 02:09.240
(Where am I?)

02:11.150 --> 02:12.430
(What is this place?)

02:12.800 --> 02:13.710
(Is it a dream,)

02:14.590 --> 02:15.560
(or an illusion?)

02:43.140 --> 02:48.620
(Shen Xihe,
Commandery Princess Zhaoning)

02:50.280 --> 02:51.400
(I never expected)

02:51.710 --> 02:53.310
(that after only three days,)

02:53.960 --> 02:56.030
(I would no longer
see the northwestern landscape.)

03:10.630 --> 03:12.520
Are you homesick, Your Highness?

03:17.190 --> 03:18.080
Ling Long.

03:18.288 --> 03:20.400
I really don't want to go
to the imperial capital.

03:21.800 --> 03:23.120
I want to spend my whole life

03:23.190 --> 03:24.280
in the northwest,

03:24.910 --> 03:26.190
by my father and brothers' side.

03:26.400 --> 03:27.840
Don't say that, Your Highness.

03:27.984 --> 03:30.496
The Duke commands 100,000
frontier cavalry in the northwest.

03:30.500 --> 03:32.112
His military achievements
are illustrious.

03:32.120 --> 03:33.220
His Majesty bestowed upon you

03:33.230 --> 03:35.000
a title of Commandery Princess Zhaoning
with a fief of 3,000 households.

03:35.000 --> 03:37.450
This summons to the palace for
Empress Dowager's birthday banquet

03:37.460 --> 03:38.680
is to arrange your marriage.

03:38.870 --> 03:41.240
I've heard the princes
who are of marriageable age

03:41.240 --> 03:42.360
are all both accomplished

03:42.360 --> 03:43.430
and exceptionally handsome.

03:43.630 --> 03:44.680
You little rascal.

03:44.944 --> 03:47.344
I've spoiled you far too much.
You've become quite unruly.

03:53.520 --> 03:54.630
You should head back first.

03:55.630 --> 03:56.750
I'll stay a little longer.

03:59.376 --> 04:00.304
Yes, Your Highness.

06:33.780 --> 06:34.784
=Blossoms of Power=

06:34.790 --> 06:37.530
(Adapted from the novel, After My
Bloom, All Flowers Wither by Jin Huang)

06:37.540 --> 06:40.500
=Episode 1=

06:46.240 --> 06:46.830
Fatty!

06:47.240 --> 06:48.480
Give us back the Immortal Vine!

06:48.920 --> 06:49.920
Yours?

06:50.430 --> 06:52.750
These hills for miles
around belong to us.

06:52.870 --> 06:54.480
Since the Immortal Vine grows here,

06:54.480 --> 06:55.600
it belongs to us.

06:55.720 --> 06:57.630
- That's right!
- Yes!

06:57.630 --> 06:59.290
The Immortal Vine
grows on a sheer cliff.

06:59.344 --> 07:00.510
You couldn't get it yourself,

07:00.510 --> 07:01.584
(Tian Yuan, Attendant to Crown Prince)
so we picked it first.

07:01.600 --> 07:03.168
Now you're jealous and stole it from us.

07:03.190 --> 07:04.688
So what are you going to do about it?

07:04.950 --> 07:07.310
Not to mention you can't take on
all of us by yourself.

07:07.430 --> 07:08.600
Just look at your master.

07:08.600 --> 07:10.510
He's so frail.

07:20.360 --> 07:22.600
So you great heroes
think you can bully me

07:23.950 --> 07:25.360
because I look weak?

07:25.360 --> 07:27.510
We're bullying you sickly weakling!

07:27.830 --> 07:28.750
Brothers!

07:28.750 --> 07:29.630
- Here!
- Yes!

07:30.160 --> 07:31.000
Get him!

07:41.824 --> 07:43.160
A little exercise will do me good.

07:44.608 --> 07:46.304
Once we return to the imperial capital,

07:46.870 --> 07:49.310
I won't have many chances
to have this much fun again.

07:49.310 --> 07:52.700
(Xiao Huayong, Crown Prince,
Seventh Prince)

08:10.190 --> 08:10.800
Where is he?

08:15.270 --> 08:16.040
Up there!

08:16.040 --> 08:17.270
Get him down!

08:17.270 --> 08:18.160
There he is!

08:40.120 --> 08:40.670
Oh, no!

08:40.672 --> 08:42.320
The Immortal Vine fell into the water!

09:51.240 --> 09:52.600
(Commandery Princess Zhaoning?)

09:54.150 --> 09:55.320
Help me...

10:03.150 --> 10:04.120
Your Highness!

10:04.840 --> 10:05.790
Your Highness!

10:08.600 --> 10:10.150
Keep the Immortal Vine for me.

10:10.840 --> 10:11.670
It saved your life.

10:11.920 --> 10:13.240
And I'll come back for it someday.

10:24.200 --> 10:25.120
Your Highness.

10:27.320 --> 10:29.390
Your Highness.
Please wake up, Your Highness.

10:35.510 --> 10:36.510
Her Highness is awake.

10:41.720 --> 10:42.960
Your Highness's pulse is steady.

10:43.030 --> 10:44.016
She's out of danger now.

10:54.240 --> 10:55.240
Your Highness...

10:55.670 --> 10:56.656
(Commandery princess?)

10:57.030 --> 10:58.030
(Who are they?)

10:58.064 --> 10:59.824
(Why are they calling me
"Your Highness"?)

10:59.840 --> 11:00.840
Bring me a mirror.

11:18.080 --> 11:18.870
Your Highness.

11:18.870 --> 11:20.080
This is all my fault.

11:20.200 --> 11:21.600
I failed to take proper care of you.

11:24.270 --> 11:25.030
Your Highness.

11:26.030 --> 11:27.720
This is my younger daughter, Zhen Zhu.

11:28.000 --> 11:29.000
Once she's grown,

11:29.080 --> 11:30.720
she will serve Your Highness.

11:32.790 --> 11:33.670
Zhen Zhu?

11:33.820 --> 11:36.020
(Zhen Zhu, Personal Maid
to the Commandery Princess)

11:38.520 --> 11:40.430
(Mo Yu, Personal Maid
to the Commandery Princess)

11:40.448 --> 11:41.150
Your Highness.

11:41.150 --> 11:42.120
This is Mo Yu.

11:42.250 --> 11:45.030
She has practiced martial arts since
childhood and knows about medicine.

11:45.040 --> 11:47.150
From now on,
she will serve as your personal guard.

11:47.360 --> 11:48.240
Mo Yu?

11:48.790 --> 11:50.150
I'm here, Your Highness.

11:51.870 --> 11:52.870
Where is this place?

11:56.030 --> 11:57.030
Your Highness,

11:57.152 --> 11:58.910
this is
the Lingxiang County Post Station.

11:59.360 --> 12:00.480
Why am I here?

12:01.080 --> 12:02.510
You came to the imperial capital

12:02.510 --> 12:04.600
to attend the Grand Empress Dowager's
birthday banquet

12:04.600 --> 12:06.190
and be matched
in marriage with a prince.

12:06.240 --> 12:07.600
Fortunately, you're safe.

12:07.840 --> 12:09.344
Otherwise, the Duke of Wei's Manor

12:09.376 --> 12:11.320
would have no way
to answer to the court.

12:11.910 --> 12:13.200
The Duke of Wei's Manor?

12:14.240 --> 12:16.910
Is Gu Zhao still the Grand Chancellor?

12:19.920 --> 12:21.210
Back then, the Gu and Fan families

12:21.220 --> 12:22.890
became embroiled
in a political struggle.

12:22.960 --> 12:24.480
The Gu family was wiped out.

12:24.840 --> 12:26.832
But later, the Fan family
also met the same fate

12:26.848 --> 12:29.200
for plotting
to murder Prince Xin's Consort.

12:29.968 --> 12:31.216
(Prince Xin finally understood)

12:31.248 --> 12:33.280
(the true purpose
of that cup of poisoned liquor.)

12:33.550 --> 12:34.630
Who else came with us?

12:34.870 --> 12:36.030
Mo Yuan.

12:36.040 --> 12:37.360
Also, Huang Zhongsi, the fifth-rank

12:37.360 --> 12:40.080
palace attendant sent
by His Majesty to escort Your Highness.

12:40.390 --> 12:41.320
And Ling Long.

12:41.680 --> 12:43.240
After Your Highness fell into the water,

12:43.240 --> 12:44.720
Ling Long jumped in to save you.

12:44.870 --> 12:46.000
She still hasn't been found.

12:48.390 --> 12:49.670
What a loyal maid.

12:50.320 --> 12:52.200
She's the one
who pushed me into the water.

12:52.320 --> 12:53.632
Anyone who didn't know the truth

12:53.780 --> 12:55.510
would think
she risked her life to save me.

12:57.088 --> 12:58.390
Report it to the authorities.

12:59.240 --> 13:00.840
Capture the runaway maid.

13:01.320 --> 13:02.270
Alive if possible.

13:02.750 --> 13:04.000
Dead is acceptable, too.

13:06.150 --> 13:07.920
- Yes, Your Highness.
- Yes, Your Highness.

13:22.080 --> 13:22.910
Your Highness,

13:23.360 --> 13:24.480
it's time for your medicine.

13:34.360 --> 13:34.960
Your Highness,

13:35.270 --> 13:36.270
Physician Xie said

13:36.360 --> 13:38.670
this medicine can suppress
the strange poison in your body,

13:38.736 --> 13:40.272
but it also harms your liver and spleen.

13:40.320 --> 13:42.670
Although the Immortal Vine
can't completely cure the poison,

13:42.688 --> 13:44.240
it can strengthen your vital organs.

13:45.360 --> 13:47.120
You risked your life to pick it.

13:47.600 --> 13:49.030
Why did you give it away so easily?

14:07.360 --> 14:08.910
(Without a moment's hesitation,)

14:09.670 --> 14:12.000
(that person used
the rare Immortal Vine to save me.)

14:15.600 --> 14:17.080
The appearance of twin moons

14:18.900 --> 14:20.630
is a sign that
the Star Gate has appeared.

14:21.670 --> 14:23.150
When twin moons hang in the sky,

14:23.550 --> 14:24.960
the Star Gate opens.

14:25.670 --> 14:27.000
Fate is rewritten,

14:28.030 --> 14:29.550
and the world is forever changed.

14:32.720 --> 14:35.232
Since when did Your Highness
learn the art of incense making?

14:35.240 --> 14:36.270
I have no idea.

14:43.720 --> 14:45.910
Since Heaven has given me this chance,

14:46.390 --> 14:47.390
this time,

14:48.352 --> 14:50.750
I will break free of these
vermilion walls and golden roofs.

14:50.928 --> 14:53.200
I will be the one who commands
the board from above,

14:53.720 --> 14:55.670
not a fallen flower

14:56.360 --> 14:57.630
left for others to pluck.

15:06.790 --> 15:07.600
Your Highness,

15:07.600 --> 15:09.200
Huang Zhongsi has caused trouble again.

15:09.480 --> 15:10.550
What happened?

15:11.240 --> 15:13.390
That eunuch abducted
a respectable young lady.

15:24.976 --> 15:26.368
(Huang Zhongsi,)
Greetings,

15:26.368 --> 15:28.360
(Palace Attendant to the Emperor)
Your Highness.

15:28.510 --> 15:30.030
If Your Highness had any orders,

15:30.360 --> 15:32.150
you only had to send for me.

15:32.510 --> 15:34.100
I shouldn't have troubled Your Highness.

15:35.750 --> 15:37.000
I deserve punishment.

15:38.600 --> 15:39.240
Mo Yu.

15:43.600 --> 15:44.200
It's all right.

15:44.440 --> 15:44.840
Come here.

16:00.000 --> 16:00.720
Zhen Zhu.

16:01.030 --> 16:03.270
Give this sachet to Huang Zhongsi.

16:03.344 --> 16:04.448
Yes, Your Highness.

16:09.480 --> 16:11.720
You were ordered to escort me
to the imperial capital,

16:11.840 --> 16:14.120
yet you've committed
such a vile act at the post station.

16:14.630 --> 16:16.150
You violated an innocent young lady.

16:16.176 --> 16:17.550
What punishment do you deserve?

16:17.550 --> 16:19.960
That young lady is a local embroiderer.

16:20.120 --> 16:21.750
She ruined my official robe.

16:22.080 --> 16:23.910
I lost my temper

16:24.030 --> 16:25.320
and slapped her a few times.

16:25.790 --> 16:28.840
She just kept crying and making a scene.

16:29.150 --> 16:30.000
Noisy.

16:30.100 --> 16:32.300
(Mo Yuan, Personal Attendant
to the Commandery Princess)

16:37.080 --> 16:39.240
I serve His Majesty.

16:39.480 --> 16:42.550
Even if I were at fault,

16:43.630 --> 16:46.720
I would answer to His Majesty myself.

16:46.960 --> 16:49.600
Your Highness has no right
to punish me at will.

16:49.790 --> 16:50.550
Otherwise,

16:50.670 --> 16:52.840
you would be disrespecting
the imperial authority.

16:56.360 --> 16:57.080
Your Highness.

16:58.080 --> 16:58.630
I...

16:59.150 --> 17:00.080
I am guilty.

17:00.200 --> 17:01.080
I am guilty.

17:01.320 --> 17:01.750
But...

17:02.670 --> 17:04.720
I don't deserve to die.

17:04.720 --> 17:05.680
Don't worry.

17:06.480 --> 17:08.160
This fall won't kill you.

17:09.240 --> 17:10.160
Today,

17:10.510 --> 17:11.880
you'll get a taste

17:12.000 --> 17:13.424
of what it feels like to be forced.

17:13.640 --> 17:14.790
Will you jump,

17:15.790 --> 17:17.640
or should I have someone help you?

17:58.750 --> 18:00.070
Huang... Huang Zhongsi...

18:00.070 --> 18:02.240
He... He was eaten by a wild beast!

18:02.310 --> 18:06.200
The sachet Your Highness
gave Huang Zhongsi...

18:06.200 --> 18:07.216
The Beast Luring Incense.

18:11.000 --> 18:12.720
How did Huang Zhongsi die?

18:14.270 --> 18:15.640
Your... Your Highness,

18:15.720 --> 18:17.480
the eunuch... The eunuch

18:17.720 --> 18:19.550
was escorting Your Highness back

18:19.632 --> 18:21.376
when he fell from his horse
into a ravine.

18:21.550 --> 18:23.030
He was then killed by a wild beast.

18:24.400 --> 18:25.270
Very good.

18:26.110 --> 18:27.240
You're a smart one.

18:27.240 --> 18:28.110
Take him away.

18:28.120 --> 18:29.110
- Thank you, Your Highness.
- Yes.

18:29.110 --> 18:31.320
- Thank you, Your Highness.
- Thank you, Your Highness.

18:35.720 --> 18:36.440
Your Highness,

18:36.656 --> 18:39.240
once they're back in the imperial
capital, they'll spread rumors.

18:39.510 --> 18:41.350
The more widely they spread, the better.

18:41.920 --> 18:43.270
What does that mean?

18:43.440 --> 18:45.312
Instead of guarding
against them in secret,

18:45.488 --> 18:47.984
I'd rather let them know
I'm not someone to be trifled with.

18:48.240 --> 18:50.160
That way, they won't dare act rashly.

18:50.256 --> 18:52.128
When someone wants
to make you their enemy,

18:52.200 --> 18:53.830
you can't hide forever.

18:54.350 --> 18:57.070
Fear only makes you easy to bully.

18:57.830 --> 18:58.750
Mo Yu.

18:59.480 --> 19:01.880
The former Commandery Princess
was innocent and pure.

19:02.310 --> 19:05.400
She was like a delicate peach blossom
untouched by wind and sand.

19:06.160 --> 19:07.750
But ever since she fell into the water,

19:08.070 --> 19:11.270
she has become
like a flower queen above all others.

19:12.510 --> 19:14.160
If she didn't look exactly the same,

19:14.590 --> 19:16.270
I'd really think she was someone else.

19:22.310 --> 19:25.110
They say Commandery Princess Zhaoning
is gentle and quiet,

19:25.150 --> 19:26.440
frail as a willow in the breeze.

19:28.160 --> 19:30.030
Yet she dared
kill His Majesty's attendant.

19:30.680 --> 19:32.000
How bold of her.

19:32.350 --> 19:33.480
More than bold.

19:33.830 --> 19:34.880
She is ruthless.

19:34.960 --> 19:36.928
Why did you save her
with the Immortal Vine?

19:38.400 --> 19:39.590
At the time,

19:39.712 --> 19:40.920
if I had not given it to her,

19:41.000 --> 19:42.110
she would have died.

19:42.176 --> 19:43.184
You should find a way

19:43.232 --> 19:45.408
to get the Immortal Vine
back as soon as possible.

19:45.830 --> 19:47.160
I already have a plan.

19:51.030 --> 19:52.110
Tagara Incense.

19:52.400 --> 19:53.110
Whose voice

19:53.350 --> 19:54.880
will you take on this time?

20:11.510 --> 20:12.160
Your Highness,

20:12.170 --> 20:14.640
Hua Fuhai, son of Jiangnan's
richest man, requests an audience.

20:14.640 --> 20:16.432
He says he wants the Immortal Vine back.

20:21.310 --> 20:22.270
Hua Fuhai?

20:33.000 --> 20:34.270
I am Hua Fuhai.

20:34.750 --> 20:35.750
I have come today

20:35.920 --> 20:37.920
to ask Your Highness to return

20:38.160 --> 20:39.110
the Immortal Vine.

20:45.920 --> 20:47.550
(That scent is Tagara Incense.)

20:48.280 --> 20:50.110
(I never expected
this man to be a merchant,)

20:51.240 --> 20:53.070
(yet use such deep and noble incense.)

20:54.880 --> 20:56.480
You say the Immortal Vine is yours?

20:57.110 --> 20:57.790
That is right.

20:57.936 --> 20:59.790
The Immortal Vine
is rarely seen in a century.

20:59.790 --> 21:00.816
It was stolen by accident.

21:01.030 --> 21:02.070
After searching everywhere,

21:02.096 --> 21:04.032
I learned it was
in Your Highness' possession.

21:04.200 --> 21:05.310
To be honest,

21:05.400 --> 21:07.200
I accidentally
fell into the river that day.

21:07.790 --> 21:09.030
A righteous man

21:09.030 --> 21:10.830
gave me the Immortal Vine
to save my life.

21:11.070 --> 21:13.070
I cannot hand over
my benefactor's possession

21:13.240 --> 21:14.920
to you based on your word alone.

21:15.640 --> 21:17.550
The Immortal Vine is a rare treasure.

21:17.790 --> 21:19.270
Each plant has a different form.

21:19.350 --> 21:20.920
This one is emerald green throughout

21:21.070 --> 21:22.350
and shaped like a lover's knot.

21:22.350 --> 21:24.350
Have I described it incorrectly?

21:29.640 --> 21:30.480
How about this?

21:31.088 --> 21:32.720
I will set up an unfinished chess game.

21:33.070 --> 21:34.790
If you can solve it,

21:34.790 --> 21:35.680
you win.

21:36.110 --> 21:38.160
Then I will return
the Immortal Vine to you.

21:38.310 --> 21:39.000
What do you say?

21:39.510 --> 21:41.070
One move decides the outcome.

21:42.310 --> 21:42.920
Very well.

21:47.000 --> 21:48.350
Young Master Hua, please solve it.

21:57.920 --> 22:00.790
Your Highness has arranged
such an ingenious puzzle.

22:01.270 --> 22:02.350
Does it have a name?

22:02.880 --> 22:03.960
It is called Moon Palace,

22:04.210 --> 22:06.000
meaning something hazy
and hard to discern.

22:06.070 --> 22:07.200
A fine name.

22:16.030 --> 22:17.400
The puzzle is solved.

22:18.790 --> 22:19.510
Wait.

22:21.110 --> 22:23.160
Young Master Hua, why not look
at the pieces again?

22:31.640 --> 22:32.720
Now,

22:33.000 --> 22:34.070
have you lost?

22:42.310 --> 22:43.590
Interesting.

22:45.240 --> 22:48.310
How did Your Highness
turn the white pieces black?

22:48.864 --> 22:50.416
There is a kind of scented powder

22:50.520 --> 22:51.880
that can color things for a while.

22:52.270 --> 22:53.310
Black can be white,

22:53.510 --> 22:54.550
and white can be black.

22:55.350 --> 22:57.070
Your Highness,
this is clearly deception.

22:57.270 --> 22:59.240
Hardly an honorable victory.

23:00.920 --> 23:01.960
All is fair in war.

23:02.592 --> 23:04.320
In this world,
it is not only a chess piece

23:04.368 --> 23:06.160
whose black and white
are hard to tell apart.

23:06.790 --> 23:08.310
Is that not true?

23:09.590 --> 23:10.440
Well said.

23:11.440 --> 23:13.440
Chess is like a battle.

23:13.640 --> 23:15.750
In the end, all that matters is victory.

23:16.350 --> 23:17.880
I was careless and underestimated you.

23:17.880 --> 23:20.480
I have learned my lesson today.
I accept my loss.

23:20.720 --> 23:21.830
For passing messages,

23:21.830 --> 23:23.030
I still have some means.

23:23.160 --> 23:24.830
They are several times
faster than horses.

23:25.030 --> 23:27.160
I am willing to serve Your Highness.

23:29.030 --> 23:30.200
Thank you, Young Master Hua.

23:44.920 --> 23:45.510
Your Highness,

23:46.160 --> 23:47.280
I think you deliberately left

23:47.290 --> 23:49.150
the Immortal Vine
with the Commandery Princess,

23:49.160 --> 23:50.870
so you would have
a reason to see her again.

23:50.880 --> 23:51.480
Am I right?

23:52.750 --> 23:53.400
Too much talk.

23:54.680 --> 23:55.640
Do not forget.

23:56.270 --> 23:57.510
We came all this way

23:58.070 --> 23:59.590
to wait for Prince Lie.

24:26.620 --> 24:29.540
(Xiao Changying,
Prince Lie, Ninth Prince)

25:07.590 --> 25:08.160
Your Highness.

25:08.192 --> 25:09.760
Prince Lie possesses the Rouge Ledger.

25:09.830 --> 25:11.720
As expected, he's
being hunted by every faction.

25:11.720 --> 25:12.920
The Rouge Ledger

25:13.110 --> 25:14.830
records which officials

25:15.270 --> 25:17.110
committed what crimes,

25:17.110 --> 25:18.510
when and where.

25:18.720 --> 25:20.310
If it falls into someone else's hands,

25:20.590 --> 25:22.480
whether for self-preservation,
to gain favor,

25:23.030 --> 25:24.550
or as leverage,

25:25.110 --> 25:26.790
it could shake the court.

25:26.832 --> 25:28.550
If Your Highness
obtains the Rouge Ledger,

25:28.750 --> 25:30.590
you'll surely find
the clue to the poisoner.

25:31.240 --> 25:34.110
But Prince Lie is risking
his life to protect it.

25:34.920 --> 25:36.000
Along the way,

25:36.000 --> 25:37.550
all his men have been killed.

25:37.550 --> 25:39.000
He's all alone now,

25:39.110 --> 25:40.160
with no chance of winning.

25:40.816 --> 25:42.480
We'll seize the chance to save Changying

25:42.528 --> 25:44.192
and learn where the Rouge Ledger is.

26:03.720 --> 26:04.790
(Prince Lie?)

26:05.550 --> 26:07.590
(Prince Xin's
younger brother, Xiao Changying.)

26:08.270 --> 26:09.400
(Why is he here?)

26:10.270 --> 26:11.350
Without my order,

26:11.424 --> 26:12.750
no one is to make a move.

26:14.528 --> 26:15.488
Yes, Your Highness.

26:31.510 --> 26:32.200
Let's go.

26:36.740 --> 26:38.700
(Ying)

26:39.088 --> 26:40.496
Your Highness, that's Prince Lie.

26:40.512 --> 26:42.830
If we knowingly
leave a prince to be hunted down,

26:42.830 --> 26:44.704
it'll be a crime
that dooms our entire clan.

27:00.310 --> 27:00.960
Save him.

27:02.496 --> 27:03.440
Your Highness.

27:03.500 --> 27:04.400
It looks like Prince Lie

27:04.410 --> 27:06.030
will be rescued
by Commandery Princess.

27:06.030 --> 27:06.960
No "looks like."

27:07.550 --> 27:08.680
I have eyes.

27:10.070 --> 27:10.880
Then,

27:11.110 --> 27:12.680
I'll bring him back later?

27:14.224 --> 27:16.240
Commandery Princess Zhaoning's
marriage alliance

27:16.240 --> 27:17.520
is a matter of great importance.

27:17.552 --> 27:18.896
We must not make a big move.

27:20.680 --> 27:21.350
Tian Yuan.

27:22.200 --> 27:23.310
We leave at once.

27:23.510 --> 27:25.200
Follow Prince Lie's trail

27:25.440 --> 27:26.350
and search for clues.

27:26.928 --> 27:27.696
Yes, Your Highness.

27:35.110 --> 27:37.400
You finally decided to help me.

27:40.480 --> 27:42.200
I failed to recognize Your Highness.

27:42.210 --> 27:43.910
Fortunately,
Your Highness is still alive.

27:43.920 --> 27:45.350
Still alive?

27:46.680 --> 27:49.160
Were you waiting for me to die first?

27:49.160 --> 27:50.048
I've long heard

27:50.064 --> 27:52.240
that Prince Lie's
martial arts are unmatched.

27:53.270 --> 27:55.200
If I hadn't thrown that jade pendant,

27:56.400 --> 27:58.680
would you have stood by
and done nothing?

28:00.810 --> 28:02.110
Please forgive me, Your Highness.

28:02.640 --> 28:04.240
I didn't know the full story.

28:04.480 --> 28:05.680
I couldn't interfere lightly.

28:06.550 --> 28:07.240
After all,

28:07.590 --> 28:10.720
the pursuers aren't always villains.

28:10.920 --> 28:12.240
They may have had no choice.

28:12.400 --> 28:13.640
Nor is the one being hunted

28:13.920 --> 28:16.200
necessarily innocent.

28:16.350 --> 28:18.200
Perhaps he brought it upon himself.

28:20.030 --> 28:22.400
I've never met a lady like you.

28:24.200 --> 28:25.270
What a

28:26.160 --> 28:27.480
beautiful face...

28:29.830 --> 28:32.000
but a venomous heart...

29:13.310 --> 29:14.000
Your Highness.

29:14.000 --> 29:15.550
Prince Lie isn't wearing any clothes.

29:15.550 --> 29:16.720
At a time like this,

29:16.720 --> 29:18.272
you're still worried about propriety?

29:21.830 --> 29:23.030
This is Mandrake Incense.

29:23.450 --> 29:24.960
It will temporarily put him to sleep.

29:27.880 --> 29:28.510
Let's begin.

29:50.720 --> 29:52.736
Your Highness. His Highness
seems to be waking up.

29:52.752 --> 29:54.560
The Mandrake Incense
won't last much longer.

29:54.576 --> 29:55.456
We have to hurry.

30:00.350 --> 30:01.510
Hold down his legs.

30:08.590 --> 30:09.310
Keep going.

31:01.550 --> 31:03.440
Why is Prince Lie holding so hard?

31:14.310 --> 31:16.200
Why are you looking at me like that?

31:17.020 --> 31:19.060
You arranged
for me to cross paths with Prince Lie.

31:19.070 --> 31:20.448
I had no intention of saving him.

31:21.590 --> 31:23.480
Yet you kept urging me to do it.

31:24.200 --> 31:25.000
What do you mean?

31:28.944 --> 31:31.536
Father had long wanted Prince Lie
as his son-in-law, hadn't he?

31:33.880 --> 31:34.830
Speak.

31:36.350 --> 31:38.350
Prince Lie and Prince Xin
are full brothers.

31:38.350 --> 31:40.480
Ever since Prince Xin cut ties
with the Gu family,

31:40.480 --> 31:41.500
he has earned great favor

31:41.510 --> 31:43.590
and become one
of the most prominent princes.

31:43.960 --> 31:45.590
If Your Highness marries Prince Lie,

31:45.720 --> 31:47.000
you'll never again be drawn into

31:47.000 --> 31:48.270
the schemes of the inner palace.

31:48.350 --> 31:49.960
Under Prince Xin's protection,

31:49.960 --> 31:51.000
you'll live a life of peace.

31:51.000 --> 31:52.960
This was the Duke's careful plan.

31:55.880 --> 31:57.440
Father truly meant well.

31:58.310 --> 32:00.160
But do you know where you went wrong?

32:01.310 --> 32:02.240
I...

32:02.432 --> 32:04.680
You were wrong to think
you knew what was best for me.

32:05.310 --> 32:07.310
What I need
is someone obedient and sensible,

32:07.750 --> 32:09.680
someone I can trust with my life,

32:09.750 --> 32:12.310
not a servant who thinks
she's helping by acting on her own.

32:12.400 --> 32:13.700
Now that I've left the northwest,

32:13.750 --> 32:16.320
I'm no longer the little girl
who needed Father and my brothers

32:16.368 --> 32:17.720
to make every decision for me.

32:18.320 --> 32:19.920
I'm about to enter the imperial capital.

32:20.240 --> 32:21.400
I can no longer

32:21.400 --> 32:23.270
remain naive and sentimental.

32:23.640 --> 32:24.790
My affairs, are for no one

32:25.240 --> 32:26.830
but me to decide.

32:28.640 --> 32:29.550
Your Highness,

32:29.550 --> 32:30.750
I know I was wrong.

32:30.750 --> 32:32.160
Please punish me, Your Highness.

32:40.550 --> 32:41.510
The imperial capital

32:42.350 --> 32:43.750
is full of tangled schemes

32:44.310 --> 32:45.720
and hidden dangers.

32:46.750 --> 32:48.270
You and I must stand together

32:48.512 --> 32:49.880
if we're to accomplish anything.

32:51.750 --> 32:52.480
Your Highness,

32:53.680 --> 32:54.750
from this day on,

32:54.750 --> 32:57.480
I will never disobey you
or neglect my duty.

33:02.110 --> 33:02.680
Your Highness.

33:02.960 --> 33:05.440
I found a rare Jade Frost Flower
on Prince Lie's horse.

33:05.640 --> 33:06.480
It doesn't grow

33:06.480 --> 33:08.030
along Prince Lie's usual route.

33:16.350 --> 33:17.790
Just as Your Highness predicted,

33:18.030 --> 33:19.830
we found a patch of Jade Frost Flower.

33:20.070 --> 33:21.110
And this patch of soil

33:21.240 --> 33:22.440
was clearly dug up

33:22.440 --> 33:23.390
and covered over again.

33:24.550 --> 33:25.200
And then?

33:26.960 --> 33:28.030
Then...

33:28.300 --> 33:29.400
we were one step too late.

33:32.880 --> 33:34.070
Who was it

33:34.200 --> 33:35.440
that beat us to it?

33:48.440 --> 33:49.640
Commandery Princess Zhaoning.

33:53.550 --> 33:55.030
Just as Your Highness expected.

33:55.550 --> 33:57.550
I headed southwest

33:57.680 --> 33:59.110
and found the Jade Frost Flower.

33:59.440 --> 34:00.350
I also found this.

34:01.580 --> 34:02.790
(This is a Jade Frost Flower.)

34:02.816 --> 34:04.260
The former Vice Minister of Personnel

34:04.270 --> 34:05.960
had a favored concubine

34:05.960 --> 34:06.750
named Yan Zhi.

34:07.160 --> 34:08.880
She persuaded the Vice Minister

34:08.880 --> 34:10.320
to sell official posts.

34:11.070 --> 34:13.360
But Lady Yan Zhi had another scheme.

34:13.710 --> 34:14.710
More than a decade ago,

34:14.800 --> 34:16.190
she recruited beautiful ladies.

34:16.190 --> 34:17.800
(The Rouge Ledger)
They were married off as concubines into powerful households.

34:17.810 --> 34:20.290
They quietly influenced their husbands
and corrupted the court.

34:20.440 --> 34:21.400
This Rouge Ledger

34:21.536 --> 34:23.070
records the crimes of court officials.

34:23.630 --> 34:24.840
This scent

34:25.440 --> 34:27.400
isn't Prince Lie's fragrance.

34:28.320 --> 34:29.590
It's Jati Blossom Incense.

34:30.920 --> 34:32.230
Rich and refined,

34:32.670 --> 34:34.000
it's a premium Buddhist incense.

34:34.760 --> 34:35.630
Her again?

34:36.190 --> 34:38.030
She beat you to it again.

34:41.030 --> 34:43.110
That little fox with two faces

34:43.440 --> 34:45.030
is becoming more and more intriguing.

34:45.472 --> 34:46.624
No matter which prince

34:46.672 --> 34:48.280
His Majesty chooses for Your Highness,

34:48.550 --> 34:50.070
if you present this to him,

34:50.150 --> 34:52.230
it will be a tremendous help.

34:52.240 --> 34:54.048
He'll surely
be grateful to Your Highness.

34:54.150 --> 34:55.360
Except for the Crown Prince.

34:57.760 --> 34:58.480
Why?

34:59.230 --> 35:01.670
The Crown Prince
has been frail since childhood.

35:01.920 --> 35:03.320
He was poisoned at the age of nine.

35:03.320 --> 35:05.730
At fifteen, he left the capital
for Luotian Temple to recover.

35:05.744 --> 35:07.440
He has no influence at court.

35:07.550 --> 35:09.150
He's a Crown Prince in name only.

35:09.480 --> 35:12.280
All the princes are waiting
for the Crown Prince to die

35:12.400 --> 35:13.920
so they can compete for the throne.

35:14.190 --> 35:15.880
Your Highness, I still think

35:15.880 --> 35:17.030
you should quickly take

35:17.030 --> 35:18.440
the Rouge Ledger back from her.

35:18.440 --> 35:20.320
The Rouge Ledger
will be mine sooner or later.

35:21.070 --> 35:23.550
Let's first see
how my brothers make their moves.

35:24.320 --> 35:25.150
A short life

35:26.400 --> 35:27.510
wouldn't be even better?

35:27.880 --> 35:28.510
Your Highness.

35:30.070 --> 35:30.920
Watch your words.

35:31.880 --> 35:33.670
Even ordinary couples have disputes.

35:34.150 --> 35:35.760
All the more so in a royal marriage.

35:36.230 --> 35:37.920
Rather than scheme and gamble on love,

35:38.064 --> 35:39.590
I'd rather find someone short-lived

35:39.744 --> 35:40.920
and have fewer entanglements.

35:41.920 --> 35:42.670
I've decided

35:43.480 --> 35:44.630
to travel with her

35:44.710 --> 35:45.744
to the imperial capital.

35:46.550 --> 35:47.630
Don't be nervous.

35:48.710 --> 35:50.590
As for who I choose as my husband,

35:50.920 --> 35:52.320
I'll have to meet them all

35:52.320 --> 35:53.280
before I decide.

35:56.070 --> 35:57.510
(The husband best suited for me)

35:57.590 --> 35:59.760
(is not a patron, but an ally.)

36:00.360 --> 36:01.840
(I don't need deep romance.)

36:02.440 --> 36:04.030
(I only need mutual benefit)

36:04.440 --> 36:05.590
(and mutual support.)

36:08.100 --> 36:14.980
(Second. Fifth. Sixth.
Ninth. Crown Prince)

36:15.920 --> 36:17.030
Everyone!

36:17.480 --> 36:18.840
This round, bet on

36:18.840 --> 36:22.190
which prince
Commandery Princess Zhaoning will marry.

36:23.630 --> 36:25.190
The Second Prince, Prince Ning,

36:25.190 --> 36:27.400
devotes himself to law
and has a fine reputation.

36:27.920 --> 36:29.710
I bet on the Second Prince.

36:29.710 --> 36:31.580
(Xiao Changmin, Second Prince,
Prince Ning)

36:31.920 --> 36:34.440
But the Sixth Prince,
Prince Yu, is handsome and striking,

36:34.440 --> 36:35.360
with an exotic charm.

36:35.424 --> 36:36.710
I think the commandery princess

36:36.800 --> 36:39.100
will be charmed by
Daxing's most handsome man.

36:39.100 --> 36:40.590
(Xiao Changyu, Sixth Prince, Prince Yu)

36:42.400 --> 36:44.120
The Fifth Prince, Prince Xin,
kept mourning

36:44.130 --> 36:46.220
(Place of His Late Wife, Lady Gu)
for his late wife for three years.

36:46.220 --> 36:47.710
His Majesty feels sorry for his son,

36:47.710 --> 36:49.760
so he will naturally consider him first.

36:49.760 --> 36:50.710
That makes sense.

36:51.150 --> 36:52.670
Our Ninth Prince, Prince Lie,

36:52.670 --> 36:54.590
is a young general,
brave and battle-hardened.

36:54.656 --> 36:57.152
The commandery princess is the daughter
of the Northwest General.

36:57.184 --> 36:59.110
They would be a perfect match.

37:00.110 --> 37:01.150
I bet on the Second Prince.

37:01.150 --> 37:02.320
I bet on the Sixth Prince.

37:03.840 --> 37:04.880
I bet on the Fifth Prince.

37:05.190 --> 37:06.030
The Sixth Prince.

37:06.030 --> 37:07.000
Bet on the Sixth Prince.

37:07.510 --> 37:08.760
The Ninth Prince.

37:21.550 --> 37:24.000
Why is he betting on the Crown Prince?

37:45.880 --> 37:47.360
You made me owe you my life.

37:47.360 --> 37:49.760
Now you're putting on
an act of playing hard to get?

37:49.770 --> 37:51.890
I am Cui Jinbai, Vice Minister
of the Court of Judicial Review.

37:51.900 --> 37:52.860
Greetings, Your Highness.

37:52.880 --> 37:54.840
If someone impersonates
a court official,

37:54.960 --> 37:56.070
what crime should that be?

37:56.760 --> 37:57.920
This incense is poisonous.

38:02.150 --> 38:03.320
You're faking it.

38:07.950 --> 38:10.890
♪I've hidden so many words♪

38:11.510 --> 38:14.310
♪Too reluctant to tell you♪

38:15.180 --> 38:22.150
♪So never uncover♪

38:22.340 --> 38:24.700
♪The sand that slips away
with one grasp♪

38:25.830 --> 38:28.560
♪The flower that withers
after one bloom♪

38:29.520 --> 38:34.860
♪Silently buried deep inside my heart♪

38:36.620 --> 38:39.440
♪Every answer I gave♪

38:40.240 --> 38:43.090
♪Was both bittersweet and absurd♪

38:43.880 --> 38:47.250
♪Hiding my tear-filled eyes
when I hurt you♪

38:47.510 --> 38:50.820
♪How hard it truly was?♪

38:53.790 --> 38:57.230
♪The wounds that healed
with just a little comfort♪

38:58.220 --> 39:00.550
♪The lies made whole
with a single embrace♪

39:01.820 --> 39:07.580
♪Pretending to be brave
as if I'd never been hurt♪

39:08.990 --> 39:12.120
♪It's a shame I never could♪

39:12.570 --> 39:15.580
♪Give you a moon in return♪

39:15.690 --> 39:22.330
♪With the same open heart you loved me♪

39:22.330 --> 39:26.000
♪I've crossed the wasteland of memories♪

39:26.870 --> 39:29.630
♪Never knowing I was lost♪

39:30.070 --> 39:33.200
♪Why don't you take me away?♪

39:33.640 --> 39:39.590
♪Lead me out of this endless game
of hide-and-seek♪

39:40.990 --> 39:44.540
♪You'll never♪

39:44.820 --> 39:54.290
♪Know how much I long to, long to♪
